# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Clean URLs (/unclaimed, /airline, /11ways, /eitc) are served automatically
# by Cloudflare Pages from the matching .html file — no redirect rules needed.
# (Adding /unclaimed -> /unclaimed.html caused an infinite loop because Pages
#  auto-strips .html back to the clean URL.)

# Per-video vanity CTA slugs -> their freebie opt-in page. Videos burn/print short URLs
# (/owed, /02, /taxcredits, numeric per-video) that have no .html of their own; without
# these, Pages falls back to the homepage/sales page and the promised freebie is lost.
# 302 (temporary) so slugs can be re-pointed later. Fixes V02 (/02) and protects V04 (/taxcredits).
/owed         /11ways     302
/01           /unclaimed  302
/02           /airline    302
/airlinerefund /airline    302
/03           /11ways     302
/04           /eitc       302
/taxcredits   /eitc       302

# AirHelp affiliate (approved 2026-10-05). EU261/UK261 claims ONLY: use only on "flying to/from the EU or UK?" lines,
# never as a general US airline offer. One slug per placement so clicks can be told apart (utm_content).
/go/airhelp     https://www.airhelp.com/en-int/?utm_medium=affiliate&utm_source=pap&utm_campaign=aff-moneyyoureowed&utm_content=myo-cheatsheet&a_aid=moneyyoureowed&a_bid=7f1ca9fa  302
/go/airhelp-yt  https://www.airhelp.com/en-int/?utm_medium=affiliate&utm_source=pap&utm_campaign=aff-moneyyoureowed&utm_content=myo-yt-v02&a_aid=moneyyoureowed&a_bid=7f1ca9fa  302
